>> title: Grilled Cheese
>> category: Sandwiches & Rolls
>> tags: cheese, bread, griddle, sandwich, lunch
>> counters: Diner, Deli
>> aka: grilled cheese, grilled cheese sandwich, toasted cheese, cheese toastie, toastie
>> pairs-with: tomato-soup
>> servings: 2
>> time: 15 min

>> step: butter the outside faces, edge to edge
Spread @salted butter{2%Tbs}(28 g; soft, not melted) over one face of each of @white sandwich bread{4%slices}, right to the crust.

>> step: fill with two cheeses, one melts and one tastes
Fill @&(~1)buttered bread{} with @American cheese{4%slices} and @sharp cheddar{2%oz}(60 g; grated), butter facing out.

>> step: griddle low, 4 min, flip, 3 min
Griddle @&(~1)built sandwiches{} in a #skillet{} over medium-low heat ~fry{4%min}, flip once and press with a spatula, then ~fry{3%min}.
